--- a/x11/sddm/files/README.pkgsrc
+++ b/x11/sddm/files/README.pkgsrc
@@ -8,5 +8,9 @@
 	> cp @PREFIX@/share/examples/pam.d/$i /etc/pam.d
 	> done
 
+On EmberBSD, the SDDM PAM examples require the base system
+PAM module pam_xdg.so. Update the base system to a version providing this
+module before enabling these session policies.
+
 You will also need to install the sddm rc.d script to run it as a
 service. These details will be noted during the installation phase.
